==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
Cyberhorn is the main threat, so bring strong [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien]] units to deal with its high health and damage. [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] units are also recommended to handle the One Horns and constant B.B.Bunny spawns. Zrocos can [[burrow]] past your frontline, so bring a few [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie]] units, preferably those with [[Zombie Killer]]. Save some resources for the Zir Zeal later in the stage.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
This one is pretty much a purely zombie stage, which means you can just spam anti-Zombie units. Although J.J. Jackrabbit is annoying, [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] should handle him just fine, so feel free to just use your best anti-Zombies and [[Holy Blast]] to breeze through.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
This stage features a dangerous combination of strong [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] and [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] enemies. Bring anti-Red units to deal with the heavily buffed One Horns. Zombie Killers are practically mandatory against Zamelle due to her unlimited revives. [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]] works particularly well in this role. Gardeneel Bros. are a non-issue since [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]] can take them out instantly.

